 707+ 869C              ; Score_CheckAndUpdateHighScore
 708+ 869C              ; Se player_score > high_score, copia player_score in high_score.
 709+ 869C              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------
 710+ 869C              Score_CheckAndUpdateHighScore:
 711+ 869C                  ; Confronto BCD a 3 byte (big-endian: byte 2 -> byte 1 -> byte 0)
 712+ 869C                  ; Byte 2:
